        "score": 10,
        "sentiment": "Excellent"
      },
      {
        "comment": "I love the attention to detail through the resort hotel. Outstanding restaurants and show venue. Would stay here again. Fun place.",
        "out_of": 10,
        "score": 10,
        "sentiment": "Excellent"
      },
      {
        "comment": "Great experience, staff was excellent food was delicious.. definitely recommend the hotel!",
