        "score": 10,
        "sentiment": "Excellent"
      },
      {
        "comment": "Loved everything about this hotel. Will definitely be back! Coffee and matcha were delicious and the pool was great!",
        "out_of": 10,
        "score": 10,
        "sentiment": "Excellent"
      },
      {
        "comment": "Love love love. Took my husband here for his birthday. Had the best time. So cute. So yummy. Great staff. Great facilities. Would love to be able to come again!",
        "out_of": 10,
        "score": 10,
        "sentiment": "Excellent"
      },
      {
        "comment": "The room was so cutesy and clean! The staff was very sweet and helpful. Valet was great. Went here for a girls night and will definitely be going back!",
        "out_of": 10,
        "score": 10,
        "sentiment": "Excellent"
      },
      {
        "comment": "Always a great stay. The vibes are immaculate and the staff is always very efficient and nice. We love coming here!",
        "out_of": 10,
        "score": 10,
        "sentiment": "Excellent"
      },
      {
        "comment": "This was a magical stay. We have two small dogs, and it was a pet-friendly hotel, not just by lip service but in practice. Everyone was wonderful, and we didn't want to leave.",
        "out_of": 10,
        "score": 10,
        "sentiment": "Excellent"
      },
      {
        "comment": "One of my favorite places to stay, you don’t have to leave the hotel. Great food, drinks, staff, and amenities.",
        "out_of": 10,
        "score": 10,
        "sentiment": "Excellent"
      },
      {
        "comment": "Everything about this hotel was great. The decor, amenities, restaurants, staff are all reasons why I will return.",
        "out_of": 10,
        "score": 10,
        "sentiment": "Excellent"
      },
      {
        "comment": "Breakfast at the diner was sooo good! Easy walk to local brewery. Cool vibe at the pool and game room. Room was comfortable and very unique Worth the price!",
        "out_of": 10,
        "score": 8,
        "sentiment": "Good"
      },
      {
        "comment": "the smeg electric kettle was awesome! Loved the pool, jazz, decor, etc. Great stay!",
        "out_of": 10,
        "score": 10,
        "sentiment": "Excellent"
      },
      {
        "comment": "This was my third time staying here, and like the two times before, I loved it. Like always, the property was clean and beautiful. The beds are the most comfortable ever. There is plenty to do, and the food in the diner and at Quixote was delicious. As typical service is generally on the slower side. Otherwise, the majority of the staff provided great customer service minus one or two bartenders that were short and a little rude. All in all, I love this place, and will be back a 4th time.",
        "out_of": 10,
        "score": 10,
        "sentiment": "Excellent"
      },
      {
        "comment": "We loved the vibe, the decor and the amenities at this hotel. Will definitely go back!",
        "out_of": 10,
        "score": 10,
        "sentiment": "Excellent"
      },
      {
        "comment": "All in one getaway. No reason to leave the property once you get there. Great food and vibes. The staff is delightful. Can’t wait to go back.",
        "out_of": 10,
        "score": 10,
        "sentiment": "Excellent"
      },
      {
        "comment": "Amazing stay! The staff is super generous and helpful. The pool is a must!",
        "out_of": 10,
        "score": 10,
        "sentiment": "Excellent"
